# Chuẩn trang con (Subpages)

## Layout pattern
- Dùng `<MarketingLayout>` cho marketing pages → Header + Footer.
- `<DashboardLayout>` cho dashboard.
- `<AuthLayout>` cho login/register/forgot.

## Page Header
```tsx
<section className="container-page py-16 md:py-24">
  <p className="eyebrow">...</p>
  <h1 className="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold">Title</h1>
  <p className="mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-lg text-muted-foreground">Lede</p>
</section>
```

## Lists / Grids
- Grid cards: `sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3`.
- Spacing `gap-6 md:gap-8`.
- Cards dùng `<InteractiveCard>`.

## Empty state
```tsx
<p className="py-16 text-center text-muted-foreground">
  Chưa có nội dung nào.
</p>
```

## Pagination
- `Link` tới trang tiếp theo. Nút `rel="next"`/`rel="prev"`.
- Cursor-based (supabase) để performance.